# 9. Module #7 — Clinical Trial Intelligence

The system should continuously examine:

```text
CURRENT PATIENT STATE
        ↓
Diagnosis
Molecular profile
Age
Prior therapies
RT history
Disease status
Recurrence status
Location
Performance status
Prior treatments
        ↓
TRIAL DATABASE
        ↓
Eligibility reasoning
        ↓
Potentially relevant trials
```

Importantly, every inclusion/exclusion criterion should show **why**:

```text
TRIAL X

Eligible:
✓ IDH status
✓ prior radiation
✓ recurrence interval

Unknown:
? performance requirement not documented

Not eligible:
✗ prior agent requirement unmet
```

A 2026 prospective study in 3,804 oncology patients evaluated neuro-symbolic AI, knowledge graphs and human review specifically for trial matching, reflecting the continuing difficulty of screening complex eligibility criteria manually. ([PubMed][9])

For your platform, trial matching becomes another output of the **Neuro Tumor State**, rather than a separate application.

