# 12. What I would NOT build first

This is important.

### Don't start with:

**A generic PACS replacement.**

Too large and unnecessary.

**Another generic tumor segmentation model.**

Brainlab and NeuroQuant are already very advanced in this area. ([Brainlab][1])

**A generic medical chatbot.**

Weak moat.

**A black-box survival predictor.**

Interesting research, but weak day-to-day workflow value.

**Autonomous treatment recommendations.**

High clinical and regulatory burden before you have the data foundation.

Instead, build the **orchestration layer above the existing systems**.

